Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_25_desc]
“Oh, Derpy Hooves, our heavenly Duchess.”\n“With eyes askew and heart so broad,”\n“In Equestria, you reign supreme,”\n“A beacon of joy, a whimsical dream.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_25_TOOLTIP]
Citizens of Cloudsdale is thinking about Saint Derpy Hooves, but what exactly they are thinking about, Derpy will never know.

